OL,3,GNEWSAThe sewage spill that cost a water
OL,4,Acompany boss #1m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company boss was denied his
OL,7,Fannual bonus worth more than a million
OL,8,Fpounds after thousands of tonnes of raw
OL,9,Fsewage ended up in a river.
OL,11,FThe BBC can reveal that almost 3,500
OL,12,Ftonnes of untreated sewage entered the
OL,13,FRiver Mardyke in Grays, Essex, on 25
OL,14,FAugust 2025, killing at least 4,723
OL,15,Ffish.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
