OL,3,GNEWSAThe sewage spill that cost a water
OL,4,Acompany boss #1m
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglian Water confirmed its chief
OL,7,Fexecutive Mark Thurston's #1.05m bonus
OL,8,Fwas withheld for the 2025-26 financial
OL,9,Fyear over the spill, following new
OL,10,Fgovernment legislation designed to
OL,11,Fimprove accountability and the
OL,12,Fperformance of water companies.
OL,14,FAnglian Water said it could not comment
OL,15,Fon the pollution incident itself due to
OL,16,Fan ongoing investigation.
